{"step_index":426,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T16:11:12Z","thinking":"`Classify`'s architecture includes convolutional, pooling, and linear layers; specifically, the final linear layer (`pm.model[9].linear`) generates 5 un-softmaxed logits. In the evaluation mode of the Ultralytics framework, `Classify.forward` applies a softmax function to these logits to produce a probability distribution over the classes. This softmax normalization results in the winning class's gradient being backpropagated.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"python -c \"\nimport torch\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\nimport numpy as np\nfrom PIL import Image\nfrom ultralytics import YOLO\n\nmodel = YOLO(r'D:\\acceleration\\best.pt')\npm = model.model\npm.eval()\n\nfor p in [r'D:\\acceleration\\dataset\\val\\rust\\rust_00003.png', r'D:\\acceleration\\dataset\\val\\scratch\\scratch_00023.png']:\n    img = Image.open(p).resize((224, 224)).convert('RGB')\n    t = torch.from_numpy(np.array(img, dtype=np.float32)/255.0).permute(2,0,1).unsqueeze(0)\n    t.requires_grad = True\n\n    features, logits_list = [], []\n    def fh_c2f(m, i, o): features.append(o)\n    def fh_lin(m, i, o): logits_list.append(o)\n\n    # Hook last conv feature map inside Classify (conv is 1280 channels!) or C2f (256 channels)\n    target_layer = pm.model[8]\n    h1 = target_layer.register_forward_hook(fh_c2f)\n    h2 = pm.model[9].linear.register_forward_hook(fh_lin)\n\n    out = pm(t)\n    \n    # Target raw pre-softmax logit\n    raw_logits = logits_list[-1]\n    top_cls = int(raw_logits.argmax())\n    \n    # Backward on pre-softmax logit!\n    pm.zero_grad()\n    score = raw_logits[0, top_cls]\n    # Compute grad w.r.t features\n    feat = features[-1]\n    grads = torch.autograd.grad(score, feat, retain_graph=False)[0]\n\n    h1.remove()\n    h2.remove()\n\n    w = grads.mean(dim=(2, 3), keepdim=True)\n    cam = (w * feat).sum(dim=1)[0]\n    cam = F.relu(cam).detach().cpu().numpy()\n    print(p)\n    print('  Pre-softmax CAM min:', cam.min(), 'max:', cam.max(), 'mean:', cam.mean())\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Testing pre-softmax GradCAM","toolSummary":"Test pre-softmax GradCAM"}}]}
